<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle $112/dressed, up $2-$3-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle $112/dressed, up $2-$3-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested, compared with Monday's close, USDA said. Carcass basis Steers and heifers $2.00-$3.00 per cwt higher.</p>
<p>Steers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1175-1300 lbs 110.00-112.00. Heifers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1075-1200 lbs 110.00-112.00.</p>
<p>Reported sales for Tues - 1,500  Week to Date - 6,500</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
